  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Tournament Mode and Game Experience</h2>\n<p>The participants find the idea of tournament mode fun, as indicated by their comments such as &#x27;That&#x27;ll be fun.&#x27; However, they are also struggling with the game and getting behind, as seen in quotes like &#x27;Not before we&#x27;re down.&#x27; To address this, they are advising each other to slow down and be careful, with statements such as &#x27;Sometimes you gotta go slow.&#x27; This suggests a mix of excitement and challenges in the gameplay.</p>\n<h2>Hinata&#x27;s Behavior and Emotions</h2>\n<p>Hinata is repeatedly saying &#x27;No,&#x27; indicating that she is not agreeing with the current situation, as seen in quotes like &#x27;No, no.&#x27; She also appears to be confused or not fully understanding the situation, as reflected in her statement &#x27;I&#x27;m losing touch.&#x27; Despite this, Hinata is trying to take action, as shown by her saying &#x27;Let&#x27;s go.&#x27; However, she is also showing signs of frustration and urgency, as seen in her repeated &#x27;No, no, no, no, no, no.&#x27; Hinata is also trying to communicate with others, as seen in her calls of &#x27;Oi.&#x27; She is attempting to analyze the situation, as indicated by her statement &#x27;I&#x27;m looking at you two.&#x27; Additionally, she is expressing dissatisfaction with the fairness of the game, as seen in her comments like &#x27;Not fair.&#x27; Hinata is clearly desiring a fair and just game, as reflected in her statement &#x27;I gotta do this fair and square.&#x27;</p>\n<h2>Speaker&#x27;s Reflections and Future Plans</h2>\n<p>The speaker is expressing gratitude to the audience for watching today, as seen in their statement &#x27;Thanks so much for watching today.&#x27; They also mention that they avoided eating cucumbers in the current session, as indicated by &#x27;I avoided the cucumbers.&#x27; Looking ahead, the speaker plans to save cucumbers for a future session, as reflected in their statement &#x27;cucumbers for next time.&#x27; The speaker is also referring to a high-risk, high-return scenario, as seen in their comment &#x27;high return.&#x27; As a reward for the audience&#x27;s performance, the speaker is offering cucumber ASMR, as indicated by &#x27;you guys get cucumber ASMR.&#x27; Specifically, they are offering cucumber eating ASMR as a reward if the audience wins, as seen in their statement &#x27;you guys get cucumber eating ASMR.&#x27; The speaker clarifies that this reward is for a future session, as reflected in their comment &#x27;But that&#x27;s for next time.&#x27; They also note that the audience has lost their chances in the current session, as seen in their statement &#x27;You lost your chances today.&#x27;</p>\n<h2>Technical and Closing Remarks</h2>\n<p>The speaker mentions that they heard their microphone peaking and apologized for any discomfort caused, as seen in their statement &#x27;I hope I didn&#x27;t make someone&#x27;s ears bleed.&#x27; They also offered a farewell greeting, as reflected in their statement &#x27;Have a great morning, afternoon, evening.&#x27; The speaker intends to address the schedule and plans to share an update later, as indicated by their statement &#x27;Probably post that later today or early tomorrow.&#x27; They are considering their next steps and emphasize the need for careful planning, as seen in their statement &#x27;Gotta plan it out carefully.&#x27;</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cNYVDSrykbo</p>",
